{
  "server": "en",
  "storyId": "main_12_level_main_12-14_beg",
  "groupId": "main_12",
  "stageId": "main_12-14",
  "title": "Clouds Burn Red",
  "storyCode": "12-16",
  "avgTag": "Before Operation",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsGamedata/en/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_12-14_beg.txt",
  "sourceHash": "c35d282ae502ac39243e441000d27de7cd62e9e0ab4086cae11c0643ae48c829",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "So this is the airship..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "'Trilby Asher'",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "All our attempts to infiltrate it ended in failure. Anyone who approached simply vanished into thin air."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "'Trilby Asher'",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "Is that some kind of Sarkaz witchcraft? Surely the Lord of Fiends would know how to neutralize it."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "I..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "Is Theresa here?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "But I can't feel—"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "Urgh!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "A heavy pressure comes over her.\nIt is far too thick, far too cruel, to be described or spoken of.\nAmiya can hardly stand."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "What... is this...?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "'Trilby Asher'",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "What are you doing, Lord of Fiends? Don't try anything funny!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "'Trilby Asher'",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "Neutralize it with your witchcraft! Or else..."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "'Trilby Asher'",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "Ugh—"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "Ascalon.",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Ascalon",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "Sorry I'm late."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "'Trilby Asher'",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "Calm down, Ascalon."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "'Trilby Asher'",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "This was all my colleague's plan! I tried to talk him out of it!"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "'Trilby Asher'",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "I don't intend to harm your Doctor. We're just getting a deal done. You'll be the witness."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Ascalon",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "Then get out of my way."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Ascalon",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "—"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "What is it?",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "......",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "You're really pale.",
          "value": "3",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Ascalon",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "You can't feel it because you're not Sarkaz."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Ascalon",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "We're coming face to face with our history. The sum of the Sarkaz's millennia of suffering."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Ascalon",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "It's angry. It's screaming, and it's making all of us listen to it."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Ascalon",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "No wonder."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Ascalon",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "Ha, the dukes are going to be disappointed. This is no engineering or technology that can be copied."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Ascalon",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "The ship itself is a revenant."
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "Argh—"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "I... the voices..."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Ascalon",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "Don't let it affect you, Amiya!"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Ascalon",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "Resist the illusion!"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "I know, I'm trying..."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "Argh—Aah—"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "'Trilby Asher'",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "The shadows..."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "'Trilby Asher'",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "No, it's not like the shadows from Ines's Arts. What is it?"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Ascalon",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "Get out of the airship's shadow, Doctor!"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "The airship's shadow wriggles, stretches. The other 'Trilby Asher' whom Ascalon knocked to the ground disappears in the dark ocean."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "'Trilby Asher'",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "What the hell is this...?"
        },
        {
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "Suffocating black, suffocating despair, suffocating fury."
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "The revenant..."
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "I see..."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Ascalon",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "Don't look, Amiya! It's the revenant's witchcraft!"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "I saw tears."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "I saw deep, heavy sorrow."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "Has this sorrow always been with you?"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "You have scorched your wound with the flames of rage."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "It's... painful."
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "Ascalon stumbles."
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "Are you ok, Ascalon?",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Ascalon",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "I... I'm fine..."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Ascalon",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "Amiya—"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "Amiya looks up towards the great shadow of the revenant.\nYou cannot see her face. You only know she is looking up."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "You're right, Revenant. I should see. I have seen."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "I have seen it all."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "All three thousand four hundred and twenty-one destructions, every brick that turned to ash."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "I saw the resistance of every King of Sarkaz. I saw their hearts, each and every one of them."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "I saw the tears and blood swallowed. I saw the dust and broken pieces."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "Familiar silhouettes fall, overlapping with one another. Familiar scenes replay themselves."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "I have seen. I see. I will see."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "I never averted my eyes, Revenant."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "I will remember."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "Every hard decision, every death and sacrifice, every destruction, every hope."
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "But I've tried—"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "I..."
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "I won't—"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "Theresa wanted me to be... she said we can share in the same feelings, even if we're not of the same blood!"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "I..."
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "Amiya finds herself at a loss for words.\nWhy does she want to stop this war?\nShe has seen the anger, the pain, the longing.\nWhy does she want to stop this war?\nThere is no other way for the Sarkaz.\nNo Sarkaz could come to any other answer, after coming face to face with it all."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "But..."
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "Amiya realizes that, for an instant, she understood Theresa's choice.\nDrown tears with tears, and bury suffering with suffering.\nOnly scorched earth will bring new life to the Sarkaz."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "But..."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "Still... I renounce this path."
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "The revenant was right.\nShe renounced it. She can never truly stand with them.\nShe can leave."
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "The shadow wriggles furiously, splitting apart, growing so thick it seems to take physical form.\nThe chaotic shadow of the revenant emerges from the empty shipyard."
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Eblana",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "Hello there, big one."
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "The purple flame impacts the black shadow."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Eblana",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "You interest me, Revenant."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Eblana",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "What ember will you leave behind when you burn?"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "'Trilby Asher'",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "—"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "'Trilby Asher'",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "That Draco... Eblana."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "'Trilby Asher'",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "Nothing in the mission brief said she would show up!"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "'Trilby Asher'",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "Go! Hurry!"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "Amiya!",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "I... I'm fine..."
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "Here, hold onto me.",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "Doctor, I..."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "They're right... I can't stand with them..."
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "Maybe that's why it has to be you.",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "...Huh?"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Ascalon",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "The Draco's fire is getting closer!"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Ascalon",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "She's strong! We shouldn't try to fight her here!"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Eblana",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Eblana",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "Hmph... interesting."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Eblana",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "Rhodes Island..."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Eblana",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "I seem to hear that name often lately."
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Royal Court Soldier",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "G-General... the Draco..."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Manfred",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "Pay no heed."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Manfred",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "Her flames burn nothing but her own short-sighted ambition."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Manfred",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "Lead us away from here, Great Revenant. This shipyard is too small for your fury. The noises of those Outblood are not worth your time."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Manfred",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "I have heard from the Regent. He is ready."
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Eblana",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "'The Brigadier'",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "Your Royal Highness."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "'The Brigadier'",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "The Sarkaz airship has taken off and is slowly turning towards Londinium."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "'The Brigadier'",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "Battleship squadrons are ready to intercept on the perimeter."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "'The Brigadier'",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "Other regiments are also assembling."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Eblana",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "Oh?"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "'The Brigadier'",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "The Duke of Windermere's fleet is already deployed near the plate. The Duke of Caster's ships are also in movement and will likely approach in short order."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Eblana",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "Looks like everyone cares a lot about this place."
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "???",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "Do they?"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Colbert",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "Aren't the dukes are little late?"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "'The Brigadier'",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "You're... the manager of that hotel?"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "'The Brigadier'",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "What are you doing here?"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "'The Brigadier'",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "You're a Sarkaz mole in Londinium?"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Colbert",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "No, Colbert is just a Sarkaz cleaner who thinks he's Victorian."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Eblana",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "What about you?"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Damazti Cluster",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "We...?"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Damazti Cluster",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "Just some poor souls made to come out and work while having a chat with a friend."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Damazti Cluster",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "You're such a spoilsport, Draco."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Eblana",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "Why not have a chat with me?"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Damazti Cluster",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "Give us a break."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Damazti Cluster",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "Let's get this over with."
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "observedOperators": []
}
